Description

Each image is corrupted by a random composition of multiple degradation types. The corruption style and severity vary from image to image. Some corruptions affect local regions (masking, patch distortion), others affect global properties (blur, noise, contrast), and some affect geometry (rotation, scaling).

Important: The exact corruption types and severity labels are not provided. You must analyze the training pairs to understand the degradation patterns.
